    desc: T(
      'Replace the mailbox of an already confirmed domain. Body: { "domain": "example.com", "email": "new@example.com" } with the Authorization: Bearer manage-… header of that confirmed mailbox — without it, with a wrong token or with the token of another domain the answer is 401 unauthorized. The old address stops receiving notifications immediately and its management token is void from now on; the new address has to be confirmed once more, so the answer is { "status": "sent", "emailed": true } (the confirmation mail went out) or { "status": "stored", "emailed": false, "verifyUrl": "…" } (no mail provider configured — that link finishes the confirmation and hands out the new management token, exactly once). The same human check applies (turnstile_token, action afr_owner_email; X-AFR-Agent-Key skips it). Errors: 400 invalid_email | invalid_domain | turnstile_failed, 401 unauthorized, 409 same_email (the address is already registered), 429 rate_limited (3 mailbox writes per domain per day, 5 per IP per hour).',
      '更换已确认域名的邮箱。请求体：{ "domain": "example.com", "email": "new@example.com" }，并带上该已确认邮箱的 Authorization: Bearer manage-… 头——缺少、错误或属于其他域名时返回 401 unauthorized。旧地址立即停止接收通知，其管理令牌当场失效；新地址需重新确认一次，因此返回 { "status": "sent", "emailed": true }（确认信已寄出）或 { "status": "stored", "emailed": false, "verifyUrl": "…" }（未配置邮件通道——该链接完成确认，并一次性给出新的管理令牌）。同样需要人机校验（turnstile_token，action afr_owner_email；X-AFR-Agent-Key 可跳过）。错误：400 invalid_email | invalid_domain | turnstile_failed，401 unauthorized，409 same_email（与已登记地址相同），429 rate_limited（每域名每天 3 次写入、每 IP 每小时 5 次）。',
    ),
    params: 'domain · email · Authorization: Bearer <manageToken>',
    example: `{ "status": "sent", "emailed": true }`,
  },
];
---

<Base title={P.title} description={P.description}>
  <div class="container docs">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow mono">AFR.IM · API v1</p>
      <h1>{P.title}</h1>
      <p class="lede">{P.lede}</p>
    </header>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.baseTitle}</h2>
      <pre class="mono"><code>https://afr.im</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{T('Reading a lookup correctly', '如何正确解读查询结果')}</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        {T(
          'Three states exist, not two. A 404 means the domain was never scanned — submit it. A 200 with grade "Pending" means it was scanned but the homepage and robots.txt were both unreadable, so it cannot be scored: a detail page exists, yet the site stays out of rankings, category pages, averages, and search. A 200 with grade A–F means it is rated and listed under /c/{category}/.',
          '状态有三种，不是两种。404 表示该域名从未被扫描——请提交它。200 且 grade 为 "Pending" 表示已扫描，但首页与 robots.txt 均不可读、无法评分：详情页存在，但站点不进入排行、分类页、平均值与搜索。200 且 grade 为 A–F 表示已评级并在 /c/{category}/ 下收录。',
        )}
      </p>
      <p class="lede">
        {T(
          'A working report page therefore does not by itself mean a site appears in the category page you guessed — check the site\'s category and grade fields first. status "delisted" marks an entry retired on request or after a rebrand; its page stays readable for history.',
          '因此，报告页可访问本身并不等于站点出现在你猜测的分类页中——请先检查站点的 category 与 grade 字段。status 为 "delisted" 表示条目已被下架（按请求或改名后），其页面仍可读取以供历史查阅。',
        )}
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.endpointsTitle}</h2>
      {endpoints.map((ep) => (
        <div class="ep">
          <div class="ep-head">
            <span class={`m m-${ep.method.toLowerCase()}`}>{ep.method}</span>
            <code class="mono">{ep.path}</code>
          </div>
          <p class="ep-desc">{ep.desc}</p>
          {ep.params && <p class="ep-params mono">{ep.params}</p>}
          {ep.example && (
            <pre class="mono"><code>{ep.example}</code></pre>
          )}
        </div>
      ))}
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.errorsTitle}</h2>
      <p class="body">{P.errorsBody}</p>
      <pre class="mono"><code>{`{ "error": "not_found", "domain": "unknown.example" }`}</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.rateTitle}</h2>
      <p class="body">{P.rateBody}</p>
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.humanTitle}</h2>
      <p class="body">{P.humanBody}</p>
      <pre class="mono"><code>{`{ "error": "turnstile_failed", "reason": "missing_token" }`}</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.ownerTitle}</h2>
      <p class="body">{P.ownerBody}</p>
      <h3>{P.ownerErrorsTitle}</h3>
      <p class="body">{P.ownerErrorsBody}</p>
      <pre class="mono"><code>{`{ "error": "domain_control_failed",
  "checks": [ { "method": "dns", "detail": "no TXT record" },
              { "method": "file", "detail": "404" },
              { "method": "meta", "detail": "tag not found" } ] }`}</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.machineTitle}</h2>
      <ul class="links">
        {P.machineItems.map(([label, detail]) => (
          <li>
            <strong>{label}</strong> — <span class="mono">{detail}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <p class="cta">
      <a class="btn" href={href('/method')}>{P.backToMethod} →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={href('/bot')}>{P.botLink} →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .docs {
    padding-top: 40px;
    max-width: 880px;
  }
  .hero {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 38px);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .lede {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-2);
    max-width: 72ch;
  }
  .sec {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 22px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .sec h2 {
    font-size: 19px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .sec h3 {
    font-size: 15px;
    margin: 18px 0 8px;
  }
  .body {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 78ch;
  }
  pre {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: var(--bg-ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--r-2);
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }
  .ep {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .ep:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .ep-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .ep-head code {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .m {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: var(--r-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .m-get {
    color: var(--grade-a, #22c55e);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--grade-a, #22c55e) 45%, transparent);
  }
  .m-post {
    color: var(--grade-c, #eab308);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--grade-c, #eab308) 45%, transparent);
  }
  .ep-desc {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 78ch;
  }
  .ep-params {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .links {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .links .mono {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 20px 0 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .sec {
      padding: 18px 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
